  "configuration_id": "config_011",
  "reason": "config_002 shows that multiprofile avgpool PCA RNA is currently the strongest setting, with both higher accuracy and F1 than singleprofile or transformer, so profile/aggregation is a promising direction. The major remaining uncertainty is whether image data contains useful signal and whether the same multiprofile avgpool setting transfers to image. config_011 tests an image-only ResNet50 model under that same profile/aggregation, isolating modality/representation before introducing fusion. This is a simpler, high-information experiment: if image is competitive, multimodal fusion becomes well motivated; if not, we avoid confounding image, fusion, and model setting in one multimodal run."
}

